  "story": {
    "day": 27,
    "title": "A Special Meeting at School",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya went to school by bus on a cold Wednesday in February.",
      "First, she put her blue bag on a chair in the classroom.",
      "Then, a nice woman from France stood near the gray board.",
      "She used white chalk and wrote her name with a smile.",
      "Kaya listened with her ears and looked with her bright eyes.",
      "The teacher said, \"I want to meet you and call your name.\"",
      "Next, Kaya looked at the clock because the lesson was difficult.",
      "After that, she checked her watch and waited for the autumn wind.",
      "Finally, she rode her bike home after school on Friday.",
      "She thought about her new friend from China and the fun day."
    ]
  }
